data: {"id": "d6d8d6204a424c50-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "d6d8d6204a424c50", "seq": 654, "ts_ms": 1789051341461, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.199, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1707, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-43871e590b97) | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 确认底层挂载机制阻塞在 `input` 卷，导致容器无法创建。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-b77230262543) | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 明确指出 `input` 卷因依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在而挂载失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` (fact-c4d1f037e907) | `reason: ContainerCreating` | 确认应用容器 `app` 正处于等待阶段，状态停滞。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-b8e168456538) | `value: 1` (labels: `reason: ContainerCreating`) | 验证集群指标与 K8s 事件中的等待状态一致。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | `pod.phase` (fact-566cbf4bd083) | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于调度后的挂载/启动阻塞期，尚未进入运行态。 |\n\n**证据说明**：K8s 事件（#1, #2）提供了最直接的因果证据，指明 `input` 卷因找不到 `unavailable-config` 导致挂载失败，从而引发容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#3）。Metric 数据（#4）从监控维度独立印证了该等待状态的存在。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在 aiops-case-03 中缺失 → Pod Spec 中 Volume 'input' 引用该 ConfigMap 且未设为 Optional → Kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败**\nKubelet 事件明确记录 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (证据 #2)。由于该 Volume 依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，Kubelet 无法完成挂载操作，导致 Pod 被阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，无法启动应用容器。该结论由 K8s 状态（证据 #3, #5）与 Metric 指标（证据 #4）相互印证。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-43871e590b97) | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 确认底层挂载机制阻塞在 `input` 卷，导致容器无法创建。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-b77230262543) | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 明确指出 `input` 卷因依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在而挂载失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` (fact-c4d1f037e907) | `reason: ContainerCreating` | 确认应用容器 `app` 正处于等待阶段，状态停滞。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-b8e168456538) | `value: 1` (labels: `reason: ContainerCreating`) | 验证集群指标与 K8s 事件中的等待状态一致。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | `pod.phase` (fact-566cbf4bd083) | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于调度后的挂载/启动阻塞期，尚未进入运行态。 |\n\n**证据说明**：K8s 事件（#1, #2）提供了最直接的因果证据，指明 `input` 卷因找不到 `unavailable-config` 导致挂载失败，从而引发容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#3）。Metric 数据（#4）从监控维度独立印证了该等待状态的存在。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在 aiops-case-03 中缺失 → Pod Spec 中 Volume 'input' 引用该 ConfigMap 且未设为 Optional → Kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败**\nKubelet 事件明确记录 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (证据 #2)。由于该 Volume 依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，Kubelet 无法完成挂载操作，导致 Pod 被阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，无法启动应用容器。该结论由 K8s 状态（证据 #3, #5）与 Metric 指标（证据 #4）相互印证。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "d6d8d6204a424c50-final", "run_id": "d6d8d6204a424c50", "seq": 656, "ts_ms": 1789051341472, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-43871e590b97) | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 确认底层挂载机制阻塞在 `input` 卷，导致容器无法创建。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubelet` (fact-b77230262543) | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 明确指出 `input` 卷因依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在而挂载失败。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` (fact-c4d1f037e907) | `reason: ContainerCreating` | 确认应用容器 `app` 正处于等待阶段，状态停滞。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-b8e168456538) | `value: 1` (labels: `reason: ContainerCreating`) | 验证集群指标与 K8s 事件中的等待状态一致。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | `pod.phase` (fact-566cbf4bd083) | `phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于调度后的挂载/启动阻塞期，尚未进入运行态。 |\n\n**证据说明**：K8s 事件（#1, #2）提供了最直接的因果证据，指明 `input` 卷因找不到 `unavailable-config` 导致挂载失败，从而引发容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（#3）。Metric 数据（#4）从监控维度独立印证了该等待状态的存在。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在 aiops-case-03 中缺失 → Pod Spec 中 Volume 'input' 引用该 ConfigMap 且未设为 Optional → Kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：Pod 依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败**\nKubelet 事件明确记录 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (证据 #2)。由于该 Volume 依赖的 ConfigMap 不存在，Kubelet 无法完成挂载操作，导致 Pod 被阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，无法启动应用容器。该结论由 K8s 状态（证据 #3, #5）与 Metric 指标（证据 #4）相互印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.0s\n├─ 问题定位: 14.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 28.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 28.7s (Evidence 20.5s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 51.952, "metrics": {"run_id": "d6d8d6204a424c50", "mttr": {"value": "52.0s", "seconds": 51.96006631851196, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 51960.06631851196, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 48758.58807563782, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6333.597183227539, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2563.476324081421}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13995.340824127197, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 28739.925146102905, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9198.527574539185, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

